look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=['micLevel:4x1'];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1700 86 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 0.6
shot mic-page
note drag the slider end to end (from shot); click an input: it becomes default
ipc panels close
